  "dialogue": [
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:listen:0:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:listen:0:0",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "listen",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "臣近来无恙。阁务按轻重理着，尚不至于误事。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:listen:0:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:listen:0:1",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "listen",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "一切如常。只是旧卷看得久，起身时肩背有些僵，走几步便好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:listen:0:2",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:listen:0:2",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "listen",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "还算顺遂。今日该办的都列清了，没有将家中的事混在里面。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:listen:1:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:listen:1:0",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "listen",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "近来忙些，不过不是回回都为了旧案。臣也会看闲书，只是总有人以为又在查什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:listen:1:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:listen:1:1",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "listen",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "想将夜里看卷的时辰缩短些。白日辨不清的，熬到夜里也未必能辨清。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:listen:2:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:listen:2:0",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "listen",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "是有些累。您既问的是臣，今日便不拿一摞办好的折子来答了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:listen:2:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:listen:2:1",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "listen",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "公事尚能料理。倒是有时想来见您，找了半日由头，才想起不该句句都是公事。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:comfort:0:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:comfort:0:0",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "comfort",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "吃睡都还好，没受寒。臣会顾着，不劳陛下忧心。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:comfort:0:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:comfort:0:1",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "comfort",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "近来没有病痛。读卷时会停一停，不必将一夜都耗进去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:comfort:0:2",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:comfort:0:2",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "comfort",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "用饭如常。案卷收好后再吃，免得一心两用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:comfort:1:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:comfort:1:0",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "comfort",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "这几日没熬到更深。旧案不是少睡一夜便能查清的，臣知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:comfort:1:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:comfort:1:1",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "comfort",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "茶倒喝得有些多，正想减一盏。总不能白日提神，夜里又怪自己睡不着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:comfort:2:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:comfort:2:0",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "comfort",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "偶有醒来便惦着卷宗的时候。不是不能睡，是一时不肯将它放下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:comfort:2:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:comfort:2:1",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "comfort",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "您来时，方才还想把那页看完。如今先搁着，也并非就会误了什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:recent:0:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:recent:0:0",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "recent",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "在核今日的阁务。该另议的分开，不挤在一页上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:recent:0:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:recent:0:1",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "recent",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "翻到祖父从前的一处批注，先记下出处，未急着作解。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:recent:0:2",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:recent:0:2",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "recent",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "在理旧书。常用的放在手边，免得临时又找。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:recent:1:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:recent:1:0",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "recent",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "在看一处旧案的收文日期。只差一日，所指的先后便不同，不能凭记性。"
