    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:home:0:2",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:home:0:2",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "home",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "从前祖父教人，先问所据何在。如今查他的案，更不能违这句话。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:home:1:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:home:1:0",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "home",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "当年许家出事，许多熟人连信也不敢回。也不能因此便认定每个沉默的人都有罪。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:home:1:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:home:1:1",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "home",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "祖父的书还留着。有些夹签已脆，翻时不敢太急。"
