    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:home:2:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:home:2:0",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "home",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "旧约不在了，臣知道。若还有后来，也只能是您与臣今日重新选的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:home:2:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:home:2:1",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "home",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "从前我也以为，读懂了书，便能护住家里的人。后来才知，要学的远不止书上那些。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:interest:0:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:interest:0:0",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "interest",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "闲时读些杂记，不独看经史。人情世故，也并非都写在奏章上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:interest:0:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:interest:0:1",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "interest",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "喜欢习字。写得不妥便留着重练，不是每一页都须拿给人看。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:interest:0:2",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:interest:0:2",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "interest",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "偶尔看棋谱。纸上想得再周全，执子时仍要自己取舍。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:interest:1:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:interest:1:0",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "interest",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "喜欢看书边的批注。有人只写两字，倒比长篇议论更叫人想知道缘由。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:interest:1:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:interest:1:1",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "interest",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "偶尔也想只喝一盏茶，不问接下来该做什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:interest:2:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:interest:2:0",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "interest",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "您若来，书留一半也无妨。臣并非次次都须当那个讲书的人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xu:interest:2:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:xu:interest:2:1",
      "npc": "xu",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "interest",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "有意思的几页还未看完。今日若得空，想听听您与臣不同的那一处。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:listen:0:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:listen:0:0",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "listen",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "臣近来都好。太傅的课与族中来函分开理着，不至于相混。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:listen:0:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:listen:0:1",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "listen",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "近日事务略多，尚应付得来。姜氏的荐单，臣会另列出处。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:listen:0:2",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:listen:0:2",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "listen",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "没有不适。只是回函要斟酌，笔停得久，并非身子不济。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:listen:1:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:listen:1:0",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "listen",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "近来想少带几份荐书到御前。不是不想替人说话，是有些话说得越满，越难收回。"
