    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:listen:1:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:listen:1:1",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "listen",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "叶家来信仍客气。越客气的时候，往往越要看清末尾那一句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:listen:2:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:listen:2:0",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "listen",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "您问近况，我却先想该回哪一份公事。这习惯，看来还没那么容易改。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:listen:2:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:listen:2:1",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "listen",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "有时也想把族里的事放一放。只是臣说了这句，明日仍会去看荐单，陛下可别误以为臣已全放下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:comfort:0:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:comfort:0:0",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "comfort",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "起居如常，陛下不必忧心。臣没有拿熬夜当勤勉的习惯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:comfort:0:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:comfort:0:1",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "comfort",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "吃睡都好。用饭时先将来函收起，倒比看着它们更有胃口。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:comfort:0:2",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:comfort:0:2",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "comfort",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "未曾受寒。课后会走几步，不在案边一坐就是半日。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:comfort:1:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:comfort:1:0",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "comfort",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "近日茶喝得淡些。家书看得再晚，也不好再添一盏浓的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:comfort:1:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:comfort:1:1",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "comfort",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "夜里能歇。真要紧的事先记着，不必时时摆出不肯休息的样子。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:comfort:2:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:comfort:2:0",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "comfort",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "是有过辗转的时候。未必全为政事，只是有些事，臣还不愿说得太明。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:comfort:2:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:comfort:2:1",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "comfort",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "您既认真问，臣也认真答：最近确实歇得少，今日便不再替自己找漂亮说辞了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:recent:0:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:recent:0:0",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "recent",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "在重排下一回的讲题。先讲如何辨荐书，不急着讲一句空泛的君道。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:recent:0:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:recent:0:1",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "recent",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "核了两份荐单，人选不同，所据也不同。臣正将差别列出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:recent:0:2",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:recent:0:2",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "recent",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "方才读叶氏来函。礼数周全，所求却不能只看字面。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:recent:1:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:recent:1:0",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "recent",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "在想一道题，若没有姜氏替它兜底，臣还会不会照原先的办法答。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:recent:1:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:recent:1:1",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "recent",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "今日的课想留一个反例。若事事都按臣说的便对，倒不像教陛下治国了。"
