    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:recent:2:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:recent:2:0",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "recent",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "想好的一番话，见着您又须重想。陛下如今越来越会挑出臣没说的那半句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:recent:2:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:recent:2:1",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "recent",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "荐单放下了。您若只来坐坐，臣今日也试试不将每句话都引回课上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:home:0:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:home:0:0",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "home",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "姜氏与叶氏有姻亲，也有各自要守的东西。同席用茶，不等于事事同心。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:home:0:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:home:0:1",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "home",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "臣出自姜氏嫡系。从小听的许多话，都先问对家门有什么用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:home:0:2",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:home:0:2",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "home",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "两家共迎陛下登基，功劳可以记，往后的官职却仍须一件件议。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:home:1:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:home:1:0",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "home",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "家里最爱说成例。可若每一桩旧例都正好利于姜氏，陛下便该多问一句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:home:1:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:home:1:1",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "home",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "叶氏不会愿意让姜氏独掌。臣同样如此，未必因为笑着说话，便没有这点心思。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:home:2:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:home:2:0",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "home",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "有些话，臣既替姜氏说过，便不能如今装作全无此事。只是您若要听臣自己的意思，臣会另说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:home:2:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:home:2:1",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "home",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "从前觉得家门与自己本是一回事。如今偶有分不清的时候，倒不知该怪谁。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:interest:0:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:interest:0:0",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "interest",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "闲时读史。尤其看一项旧制，是怎样在不知不觉间变成了另一回事。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:interest:0:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:interest:0:1",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "interest",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "也喜欢对弈。输赢有趣，知道自己在哪一步看轻了对手，更有趣。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:interest:0:2",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:interest:0:2",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "interest",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "偶尔习字。字要收得住，人未必能，因而更须练。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:interest:1:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:interest:1:0",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "interest",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "看棋时喜欢留一处未定。都算尽了，旁人的下一手便没什么意思。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:interest:1:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:interest:1:1",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "interest",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "有时读完旧事，想的不是谁对谁错，而是当时还有没有别的路。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:jiang:interest:2:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:interest:2:0",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "interest",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "您如今落子，已不像在答臣出的题了。臣不敢说全无失落，倒也舍不得不看。"
