      "id": "daliang:jiang:interest:2:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:jiang:interest:2:1",
      "npc": "jiang",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "interest",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "得闲时，也会想听一句不问利害的话。只是先说好，臣未必就答得好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xie:listen:0:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:xie:listen:0:0",
      "npc": "xie",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "listen",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "奴才近来都好。内廷当值照旧，京中的来话已另交人分轻重。"
