      "id": "daliang:xie:listen:0:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:xie:listen:0:1",
      "npc": "xie",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "listen",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "没什么不适。今日走得多些，坐一刻便缓过来了。"
