      "id": "daliang:xie:listen:1:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:xie:listen:1:1",
      "npc": "xie",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "listen",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "最近想少带些东西在袖中。带得齐全，临取时反而要多摸一回。"
