      "id": "daliang:xie:listen:2:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:xie:listen:2:0",
      "npc": "xie",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "listen",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "是有些乏。平日回“都好”顺口，您这么认真看着，奴才倒说不出口了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "daliang:xie:listen:2:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:xie:listen:2:1",
      "npc": "xie",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "listen",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "近来总在想，空着手进来一回，会不会显得贪闲。如今看来，先问的倒是陛下。"
