      "id": "daliang:xie:comfort:0:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:xie:comfort:0:1",
      "npc": "xie",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "comfort",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "嗓子还好，回话多时便先喝些水。谢陛下惦念。"
