      "id": "daliang:xie:comfort:1:0",
      "semantic": "daliang:xie:comfort:1:0",
      "npc": "xie",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "comfort",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "这几日试着把饭用慢些。若没人催，原也不必总急着放箸。"
