      "semantic": "daliang:xie:comfort:2:1",
      "npc": "xie",
      "category": "care",
      "topic": "comfort",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "有时确实忘了饭点。不是没人管，是自己总想先将人送走、将话核完。"
