      "id": "daliang:xie:recent:1:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:xie:recent:1:1",
      "npc": "xie",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "recent",
      "minTier": 1,
      "reply": "京中话传得快，原来三个字，过几道手便能变成一段。倒比话本还会添。"
