      "id": "daliang:xie:recent:2:1",
      "semantic": "daliang:xie:recent:2:1",
      "npc": "xie",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "recent",
      "minTier": 2,
      "reply": "想着给您递茶。许首辅与姜大人都各有一番道理，奴才今日先不替谁添这把火。"
