      "semantic": "daliang:xie:interest:0:1",
      "npc": "xie",
      "category": "chat",
      "topic": "interest",
      "minTier": 0,
      "reply": "喜欢逛书铺，也看人怎样议价。人在以为无关紧要时，话倒最真。"
